		)
		(uuid "dc2f5281-8a12-4901-8a51-7473f6e6f2b0")
	)
	(text "2. AMS1117 maximum input is 15 V. With 12 V in, U2 dissipates approx. 6.3 V x I (0.2 A = 1.3 W): keep the load low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 55.626 139.446 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 60 68 74 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f67bf006-e4f8-4254-89b2-4b300228650d")
	)
	(text "4. IMPORTANT: +5V is also fed by the FTDI module (J3 pin 3, sheet 04) with no switch or diode, back-feeding U2 when the jack is off."
